==Swedish==

===Etymology===
{{suf|sv|tumme|t1=thumb|a}}

===Verb===
{{sv-verb-reg}}

# to [[thumb]] (touch or manipulate with one's thumb)
# to confirm mutual agreement (sometimes by parties pressing their right thumbs against one other), to [[shake on it]], to [[pinky swear]]
#: {{ux|sv|Vi '''tummade på det'''|We '''shook on it'''}}
# to [[skimp]] (on something)
#: {{ux|sv|De '''tummade''' på säkerheten|They '''skimped''' on security}}
# {{lb|sv|chiefly|historical}} to [[measure]] (lumber) in [[inches]] ({{m|sv|tum}})

